    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Diana. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766857061266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 18179,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766857065866666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Could I get your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766857067866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark Peterson. Order number is VF88602.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 18179,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766857073866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Mark. Pulling that up now... I see you purchased our VeloFit cycling shoes. Is that correct?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766857076666666
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 18179,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766857083733332
    },
    {
