      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766857084433332
    },
    {
      "text": "They just don't work. I keep getting blisters on every ride. Doesn't matter how I position the cleats.",
